         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>
               Prayer of the Virgin Mary on Bartos (identified by <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6378Ludolf">Ludolf</t:persName>, <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3562Dillmann">Dillmann</t:persName> and <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10747Zotenbe">Zotenberg</t:persName> as Berytus, i.e. <t:placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LOC1833Beirut">Bayrūt</t:placeName>, 
               but probably from the Παρθος, cp. <t:bibl>
                  <t:ptr target="bm:Guidi1888Atti"/>
                  <t:citedRange unit="page">9</t:citedRange>
               </t:bibl>), by which she delivered the <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS11023Mathias">Apostle Mathias</t:persName>.
              It is used for magical purposes. 
            </t:p>
         </t:abstract>
